            <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_3633097b">
               <extent xml:id="extent_bda80b15">4 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_12cbc8ab">25 x 31.5</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_b9173907">Written in brown ink. Paper: 14 staves. Title above the first stave: "Andantino religioso" [later addition in another pen:] (NB Introductionen staaer paa sidste Side) [The Introduction is written on the last page]". The introduction is written in a pen different from that of the Andantino (the same pen as used for the corrections in the Andantino). Addition in the margin of the first music page: "N<rend xml:id="idm34" rend="sup">b</rend> dette Stykke afskrives i 6/8 med Udeladelse af hver anden Taktstreg" (The piece to be copied in 6/8 by leaving out every second bar-line). Addition after the last bar of p. 4: "Segue Andantino rel: pag 1". On pp. 3 and 4 there are a number of corrections and cancellations.</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
